# 2026-09-10: real secrets that live at the project root as plain files --
# neither was ever actually excluded before, despite both holding a live,
# working credential (found while investigating a client/server API-token
# mismatch; see claude/milestone5-internet-reachability.md section 6).
# server_data/server_config.json holds the server's self-provisioned API
# token in plaintext. laptop_smb_credentials.json (new, see
# setup_laptop_smb_account.ps1 and remote_deploy.bat) holds a real working
# Windows account password for the laptop's SMB share.
